# Never upload the Electron desktop app's build output (multi-GB, entirely
# irrelevant to the Vercel web deployment) - this caused a real deploy
# failure ("Array buffer allocation failed" in the Vercel CLI) when this
# file didn't exist and the CLI attempted to scan/bundle it.
electron-dist/
electron/r-scripts/
electron/assets/
build/

# Local dev artifacts, never part of a deployment
*.log
